const WD=[['💰','Save on Electricity Bills','Generate your own electricity and reduce your dependence on grid power, so your monthly bills come down.'],['🌿','Clean & Sustainable','Solar energy is clean and renewable, and helps reduce your carbon footprint.'],['📈','Long-Term Savings','A solar system is a long-term investment that can deliver savings for many years.'],['⚡','Energy Independence','Generate power from your own rooftop and rely less on increasing electricity costs.'],['🏠','Increase Property Value','A well-installed solar system can make your property more energy-efficient and attractive.'],['🔧','Low Maintenance','Solar panels require minimal maintenance and are designed for long-term performance.']];
